<#f0f000>Character-Specific Mechanics</>
Propeller Pack						_AIR_U
Fly							Any Direction During Propeller Pack

Kannon Ball
<#bebebe>The Kannon Ball shot out from Blunderbuss will be 
launched into the air whenever K. Rool uses any of the 
following moves.
_D_+^C
^C
_AIR^C
Kremling Quake
Krocodile Driver (after succesfully grabbing the opponent) 
Spine Kruncher (after succesfully grabbing the opponent)
Using Blunderbuss again or getting hit will make the initial 
Kannon Ball disappear.</>

<#6f8053>Kloaking</>
<#bebebe>K. Rool becomes invisible upon using </><#6f8053>Kloaking</><#bebebe>, and will 
remain invisible until one of the following conditions is 
met. 
K. Rool takes damage from any source. 
The opponent is grabbed.
Ultra Burst is activated.
A Distortion Drive is activated. 
Astral Heat is activated.
The round ends.
Just like any other special move, this can be canceled 
from any of K. Rool's normals. If you're quick and 
precise enough with your inputs, you can follow it up with 
another attack, as if it were a pseudo Rapid Cancel.</>

<#f0f000>Universal Mechanics</>
Dash				_XFF/~F^A_+^B
Back Dash			_XBB/~B^A_+^B
Super Jump			_TAP_D,_TAP_U
Dead Angle Attack 		_F_+^X while blocking
<#bebebe>(1000 meter required)</>
Rapid Cancel			^X while attacking
<#bebebe>(1000 meter required; 500 for Distortion Drives)</>
Dodge				^Y
Dodge Roll			_B_+^Y/_F_+^Y
Grab				^Z (Air OK)
<#bebebe>Can be used while dashing</>
Burst				^Y_+^Z when hit
Ultra Burst			^Y_+^Z in neutral
Ultra Dead Angle		^Y_+^Z while blocking
<#bebebe>Can only be used if Burst is available</>